<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<databaseChangeLog
    xmlns="http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog"
    xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
    xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog
        http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog/dbchangelog-latest.xsd">

    <!--
        FOR-04-19 follow-up (Requirement 7.8 / R7.3 finishing branch): seed the FINISHING
        analog-group material TYPES referenced by the finishing rows of
        FOR-04-RESEARCH-material-norms/work-material-norms.csv so the consumption seed
        (069) resolves the finishing branch instead of inserting nothing (closing the
        finishing вилка = 0 gap).

        PROBLEM this closes:
          069's finishing INSERT...SELECT resolves each finishing row's CSV `material_type`
          against the FOR-04-16 `material_types` dictionary BY CODE. The CSV finishing
          `material_type` values are UPPER_SNAKE analog codes (e.g. KLEJ_DO_PLYTEK) that are
          NOT present in `material_types` (which uses lowercase semantic codes such as
          `laminat`, `winyl`). So EVERY finishing (row, package) pair was unresolved and
          inserted no row — the finishing money range collapsed to 0 for every work.

        WHAT this changeset does:
          Inserts the distinct finishing analog TYPES with `code` = the verbatim UPPER_SNAKE
          CSV value, so 069's finishing sub-selects (`... material_types tp WHERE tp.code =
          '<UPPER_SNAKE>'`) now resolve. Only the TYPE dictionary is seeded here; concrete
          finishing materials are a separate concern (the analog batch may still be empty,
          which is a valid 0..0 band per R4.6 — but the consumption ROWS now exist and carry
          a non-null finishing_material_type_id, which is what R7.3/R7.8 require).

        SCHEMA of material_types (046-create-material-types.xml / MaterialTypeEntity):
          columns id, code (NOT NULL unique), name_ru (NOT NULL), name_pl (NOT NULL),
          active (NOT NULL default true), + 4 audit columns. There is NO category FK or any
          other non-null reference on material_types, so no category linkage is needed;
          each row supplies code + name_ru + name_pl + active=true (audit created_date
          defaults to NOW(), created_by set to the seed marker).

        ORDERING (critical): this file's <include> is registered in changelog.xml IMMEDIATELY
        BEFORE the 069 include, i.e. ...067, 068, 070, 069. On a FRESH database the finishing
        types therefore exist before 069 runs, so 069's finishing INSERT...SELECT rows now
        resolve and the finishing consumption rows are inserted. (069 is guarded by
        MARK_RAN on created_by='seed:for-04-19'; since a fresh DB has no such rows, 069 runs
        and its finishing inserts resolve.)

        IDEMPOTENCY (R7.6): each insert is guarded by
          <preConditions onFail="MARK_RAN"><sqlCheck expectedResult="0">
            SELECT COUNT(*) FROM material_types WHERE code='<CODE>'</sqlCheck></preConditions>
        so a re-run against an already-seeded database inserts nothing. Codes that already
        exist in material_types (none of the 21 currently do) would simply MARK_RAN.

        DISTINCT FINISHING TYPES PARSED FROM work-material-norms.csv (branch=finishing):
          615 CSV rows parsed; 96 finishing rows; 21 distinct finishing material_type codes
          (rows per code):
            KLEJ_DO_PLYTEK (26), FARBA_DEKORACYJNA (15), PANEL_WINYLOWY (8),
            FARBA_DEKORACYJNA_KOLOR (6), FUGA_EPOKSYDOWA (6), FUGA_CEMENTOWA (4),
            LISTWA_PRZYPODLOGOWA (4), PODKLAD_PODLOGOWY (4), SZTUKATERIA (3),
            DESKA_WARSTWOWA (2), FARBA (2), FILC_SCIENNY (2), FOLIA_PAROIZOLACYJNA (2),
            LAMELE_SCIENNE (2), PANEL_LAMINOWANY (2), SILIKON (2), TYNK_DEKORACYJNY (2),
            PODKLAD (1), TAPETA_FLIZELINOWA (1), TAPETA_WINYLOWA (1), TASMA_MALARSKA (1).
          Total finishing type rows to seed: 21 (all NEW — none present in material_types).
    -->

    <changeSet id="070-seed-finishing-material-types-research-DESKA_WARSTWOWA" author="foremen">
        <preConditions onFail="MARK_RAN">
            <sqlCheck expectedResult="0">SELECT COUNT(*) FROM material_types WHERE code = 'DESKA_WARSTWOWA'</sqlCheck>
        </preConditions>
        <insert tableName="material_types">
            <column name="code" value="DESKA_WARSTWOWA"/>
            <column name="name_ru" value="Инженерная доска"/>
            <column name="name_pl" value="Deska warstwowa"/>
            <column name="active" valueBoolean="true"/>
            <column name="created_by" value="seed:for-04-19"/>
        </insert>
    </changeSet>

